---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Privacy - QuietPDF never uploads your files"
  description="How QuietPDF keeps your files on your device, and how to verify it yourself with your browser's developer tools."
>
  <article class="prose">
    <h1>Privacy</h1>
    <p>QuietPDF processes every file inside your browser. Your files are never uploaded: there is no server that could receive them.</p>
    <h2>Verify it yourself</h2>
    <ol>
      <li>Open your browser's developer tools and switch to the Network tab.</li>
      <li>Add a file to any tool and run it.</li>
      <li>Every request you see goes to this site only, and none of them carries your file.</li>
    </ol>
    <p>The privacy meter at the bottom of every page counts third-party requests and uploaded bytes live. Both stay at zero.</p>
    <p>The full policy, including the exact Content-Security-Policy this site sends, is being finished.</p>
  </article>
</Base>

<style>
  .prose {
    max-width: 42rem;
    padding: var(--space-4) 0;
  }
</style>
